## Integration acceptance

- In a safe test installation, try the created, partly uploaded, invalid-key and interrupted states with synthetic archives.
- Check that the confirmation names the contents and what will be replaced before any restore starts.
- Keep a file rollback, a backup integrity check and a restore test as three separate pieces of evidence.

Record the environment, versions, state, method and result in the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). A local example does not show that a device acted, that a screen reader works or that the live system is compatible.

For a dropped connection see [Connection loss and recovery](connection-and-recovery.html). For the wording of partial and uncertain outcomes see [States, requests and errors](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html).

